12
00:00:57,740 --> 00:00:59,340
These wires were bent aside.

13
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:01,260
I placed cardboard on top.

14
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:07,000
And by tapping the cardboard with a little hammer, I transferred the locations of the transformer leads onto it.

15
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:09,840
And then it's a matter of technique.

16
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:16,540
Cut around them, apply it on tape to the surface, and after that it's easy to transfer the locations of the future holes.

17
00:01:20,820 --> 00:01:22,800
